
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Rockhounds Gems & Treasures</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Explore gemstones, fossils, cabochons, jaspers, agates, and unique natural treasures at Rockhounds Gems & Treasures.">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      background: #f7f3e9;
      color: #26382d;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #183c30;
      color: #fff9e9;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 16px;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 29px;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: #dfd5b9;
    }

    nav {
      background: #102b22;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px 6px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 55px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #382451, #14665e);
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e7c98a;
      color: #20382c;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 23px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 35px 18px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .intro {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .item {
      background: white;
      padding: 22px 14px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 9px;
      border: 1px solid #e2d8c5;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #26382d0d;
    }

    .gem {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .item h3 {
      margin: 4px 0;
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .item p {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .feature {
      background: #e8e1d0;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .feature h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer {
      background: #183c30;
      color: #f7f3e9;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 15px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 400px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 29px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 0 5px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Rockhounds Gems & Treasures</h1>
    <p>Natural Beauty. Unique Finds. Rockhound Passion.</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#collection">Collection</a>
    <a href="#trips">Trips</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <h2>Discover Nature's Hidden Treasures</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to Rockhounds Gems & Treasures,
        a growing collection of beautiful gemstones,
        fascinating fossils, and one-of-a-kind finds.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#collection">Explore the Collection</a>
    </section>

    <section id="collection">
      <h2 class="section-title">Explore Our Collection</h2>
      <p class="intro">
        Every stone has a story. Explore our growing
        selection of natural treasures and handmade creations.
      </p>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="item">
          <div class="gem">💎</div>
          <h3>Gemstones</h3>
          <p>Opals, labradorite, and other fascinating stones.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="item">
          <div class="gem">🌋</div>
          <h3>Agates & Jaspers</h3>
          <p>Colorful patterns and natural formations.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="item">
          <div class="gem">🦴</div>
          <h3>Fossils</h3>
          <p>Petrified wood, dinosaur bone, and ancient wonders.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="item">
          <div class="gem">✨</div>
          <h3>Cabochons</h3>
          <p>Polished stones ready for your next creation.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="item">
          <div class="gem">🪨</div>
          <h3>Rough & Polished</h3>
          <p>Natural specimens and beautifully finished stones.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="item">
          <div class="gem">🛠️</div>
          <h3>Handmade Treasures</h3>
          <p>Unique creations, including knife handles and buttons.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="intro">
        More treasures are being added. Check back as our
        collection grows.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="trips">
      <div class="feature">
        <h2>Explore Washington State</h2>
        <p>
          Interested in rockhounding adventures?
          We're working toward trips for people who love
          discovering the natural beauty of Washington.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Adventure plans coming soon!</strong></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <h2 class="section-title">Let's Connect</h2>
      <p>
        Have a question about a gemstone or a future listing?
        We'd love to hear from fellow rockhounds.
      </p>
      <p>Contact information coming soon.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p><strong>Rockhounds Gems & Treasures</strong></p>
    <p>Celebrating the beauty of the natural world.</p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Rockhounds Gems & Treasures</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
